  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the first floor bedroom size and failure to demonstrate provision of functional communal areas would not meet the reasonable needs of occupiers as a six bedroom HMO, contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3, D4, D5, and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD5, DMD6, DMD8 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the London Housing Supplementary Planning Guidance (2016).",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of adequate cycle storage, fails to provide a secure, convenient and high quality facility for all types of bicycles and would fail to promote or prioritise the use of sustainable modes of transport, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies T2, T3, T4, T6, T6.1 and T7 of the London Plan (2021), CP24 and CP25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD45, DMD46, DMD47 and DMD48 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of adequate waste storage, fails to provide a convenient and accessible facility for managing waste generated by the development, contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2021), Policies T2, T3, T4, T6, T6.1 and T7 of the London Plan (2021), CP22 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), DMD45, DMD46, DMD47, DMD48 and DMD57 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the Enfield Household Recycling and Waste Planning Guidance for New Developments (2024)."
  ],
